'''Primeape''' (Japanese: '''オコリザル''' ''Okorizaru'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

