==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Jungle|Primeape|43}} from the {{TCG|Jungle}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Primeape}}.
*'''Fight Back''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Platinum|Vigoroth|64}} from the {{TCG|Platinum}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

